## 2. Optional JSON task object

Use the existing machine fields and examples in the original task packet and the [handoff contract](../references/交接约定.md). Preserve `source_ids`, `requirement_ids`, `input_bindings`, `entry_conditions`, `steps`, `planned_tests` and their IDs. Preserve locators and quotations. Keep `runtime_results: []` until a real application check runs.

## 3. Status conventions

| Status | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| draft | Task details are still being written. |
| blocked | A required entry condition is unmet or unknown. |
| ready | Current prerequisites are satisfied under existing authorization. |
| running | Execution has started. |
| needs_recheck | A change affected the task inputs, contracts or evidence. |
| completed | Current evidence supports this task's deliverables and assertions. |
| failed | The actual result failed an assertion. |
| cancelled | Execution stopped. Retain partial work and recheck conditions before resuming. |
